---
title: 'Annotations Test'
---

## Initial State

What to test:

- Annotations defined in `initialState` render on load at the correct positions.
- Crosslines remain visible alongside the seeded annotations.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Initial State" name="initial-state" type="generated" /%}

## Simple Cartesian

### Simple Area

What to test:

- Each annotation tool draws cleanly on the area series and persists across redraws.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Simple Area" name="simple-area" type="generated" /%}

### Simple Bar

What to test:

- Annotations anchor to category x values and stay aligned when the chart resizes.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Simple Bar" name="simple-bar" type="generated" /%}

### Simple Line

What to test:

- Line, horizontal and trend annotations snap to data points and remain editable after creation.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Simple Line" name="simple-line" type="generated" /%}

### Simple Scatter

What to test:

- Annotations place anywhere on the scatter plane and reposition correctly on zoom and pan.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Simple Scatter" name="simple-scatter" type="generated" /%}

### Simple Histogram

What to test:

- Annotations render over histogram bins without offset artefacts.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Simple Histogram" name="simple-histogram" type="generated" /%}

### Simple Candlestick

What to test:

- Annotations align to the time axis and survive a series-type switch without orphaning.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Simple Candlestick" name="simple-candlestick" type="generated" /%}

## Right Y Axis

What to test:

- Annotations bind to the right-positioned y axis and follow its scale on drag.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Right Y Axis" name="right-y-axis" type="generated" /%}

## Category Y Axis

What to test:

- Annotations snap to category y values on the horizontal box-plot and stay aligned after redraws.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Category Y Axis" name="category-y-axis" type="generated" /%}

## Log Y Axis

What to test:

- Value annotations render at the correct log-scale position and stay stable on zoom.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Log Y Axis" name="log-y-axis" type="generated" /%}

## Multiple Y Axes

What to test:

- Annotations bind to the intended y axis (left or right) and respect its scale when dragged.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Multiple Y Axes" name="multiple-axes" type="generated" /%}

## Multiple Left Axes

What to test:

- Annotations created against either left-side axis remain bound to that axis and do not jump scales.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Multiple Left Y Axes" name="multiple-left-axes" type="generated" /%}

## Time X Axis

What to test:

- Annotations on the OHLC series snap to time-axis values and persist across pan and zoom.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Time X Axis" name="time-axis" type="generated" /%}

## Grouped Category X Axis

What to test:

- Annotations align to leaf categories and stay stable when grouping is rebuilt.

